{
  "project_id": 20,
  "project_label": "gemma",
  "task_id": 8240,
  "title": "How to succeed in your new job",
  "author": "Gorick Ng",
  "url": "https://www.ted.com/talks/gorick_ng_how_to_succeed_in_your_new_job",
  "annotation_id": null,
  "completed_by": 7,
  "created_at": "2026-05-07T01:32:38.325176Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-05-07T01:32:38.325176Z",
  "lead_time": 50.061,
  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 65,
        "text": "In many workplaces, there are rules that are completely unspoken.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CF076B4972",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 51,
        "endOffset": 96,
        "text": "you won't find them in your employee handbook",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5E97B0AFBB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 97,
        "text": "Understanding them is crucial for success, and yet you won't find them in your employee handbook.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DCC4845DB4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 7,
        "endOffset": 82,
        "text": "you're lucky enough to have a mentor or manager who pulls you aside to help",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "52387E338B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 214,
        "text": "Unless you're lucky enough to have a mentor or manager who pulls you aside to help, you just kind of have to figure them out on your own. [The Way We Work] Starting a new job can feel like starting at a new school.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CF5219BB78",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 141,
        "text": "You're meeting new people, you're getting thrown into unfamiliar situations, and you’re constantly wondering: What does everyone think of me?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7D9025C824",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 131,
        "text": "But whether you're starting your first job ever or just starting a new role, making a great impression doesn't have to be so scary.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "92F8068CAF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 21,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "deciphering those unspoken rules",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5B43907877",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 139,
        "text": "It all comes down to deciphering those unspoken rules and demonstrating what I call the three Cs: competence, commitment and compatibility.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "336D3F36AB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "The first C is competence.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B7D305DD16",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 45,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "looking at you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "528C922F4D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 94,
        "text": "On day one, your new colleagues are probably looking at you and thinking: Can you do your job?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "911A56527F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 138,
        "text": "The way to convince others, not to mention yourself, that yes, you can, is to show your homework and to give others something to react to.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "86C8686A5E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 52,
        "text": "Let’s say it’s your first day, and it’s utter chaos.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C33C58DB2C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 143,
        "text": "People are forwarding you messages with nothing more than a \"See below\" at the top and pulling you into meetings without any notice or context.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C11590CD56",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "Your manager just gave you a task, and two minutes in you're already confused.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AC7F2EEA67",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 242,
        "text": "Instead of going back to them right away and saying, “I don’t know what to do next, help!” Or doing what I did, which is not asking questions at all, think about a similar task that you tried in a previous job, in school or just for yourself.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DC202EFE66",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "What steps did you take then?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E6D6FE1015",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "Then make your best guess and just give it a try.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DADD7DFEE6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 16,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "your manager",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6B0F7D0E32",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 99,
        "text": "Then go back to your manager and say, “I’m working on X, and I'm not quite sure of what to do next.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CD484E8BB8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 115,
        "text": "I've taken X steps and spoken to so-and-so and I understand this part, but I'm still unclear about this other part.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "46538B7BC9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "What do you think about this approach?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DB6959DF59",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 32,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "fake it till you make it",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "52DAAD3F1A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 58,
        "endOffset": 82,
        "text": "but what I am suggesting",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B9227A47D3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 127,
        "text": "No, I'm not suggesting that you fake it till you make it, but what I am suggesting is that you try until you can't try anymore.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BF604A439C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "Time matters, though, so give yourself a limit.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5F1522C1EA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 17,
        "endOffset": 30,
        "text": "your deadline",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2D6E3E5AE4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "And depending on your deadline, figuring things out on your own.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "51B7F8E59B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "Then ask and then learn",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2017E095AA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "Then ask and then learn from what others tell you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C612815F1E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 61,
        "text": "It's your first bit of knowledge around how things work here.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "22C87C048E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "The second C is commitment.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6714879243",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 47,
        "endOffset": 62,
        "text": "your colleagues",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B00CCC7558",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 90,
        "endOffset": 106,
        "text": "you're dedicated",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BF4F2E8DB1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 107,
        "text": "Besides looking to see if you can do your job, your colleagues are also looking to see if you're dedicated.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "89898B3BCA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 48,
        "endOffset": 60,
        "text": "your manager",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "453B49E82A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 90,
        "text": "During your first week in a new job, try asking your manager questions about expectations.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "23C3FCA005",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 62,
        "text": "My favorites are one, what are my top priorities in this role?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B9701A3198",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 67,
        "text": "Two, how would you like to communicate day-to-day and week-to-week?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F0BA902C80",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 83,
        "text": "And three, what have your highest performers done that you'd suggest that I do too?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "54281BBAFF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 4,
        "endOffset": 14,
        "text": "your peers",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "84B5978E01",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "For your peers, try to go more casual.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B3F6C20D77",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "In your first few days",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E3112D7CD1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 146,
        "text": "In your first few days, your manager will be probably, or well, at least hopefully, taking you around and introducing you to your other teammates.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C3C1CDA37A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 42,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "transform some of those \"Hi's\" into conversations",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "660C5C76C9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 107,
        "endOffset": 139,
        "text": "conversations into relationships",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C140AEBF87",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 140,
        "text": "In those moments, think about how you can transform some of those \"Hi's\" into conversations and then those conversations into relationships.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8984949F6A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "One option is to ask how others' weeks are going.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3532CF2F58",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 243,
        "text": "invisible swim lanes",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6BF96B9822",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 114,
        "endOffset": 149,
        "text": "Oh, I’d love to get your input on A",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F0DDC4BD1A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 156,
        "endOffset": 185,
        "text": "Could I get your advice on B?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "002FFD98B7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 243,
        "text": "For those you really get along with, try involving them in your work and maybe even your life with phrases like, “Oh, I’d love to get your input on A.” Or “Could I get your advice on B?” These can all go a long way in deepening a relationship.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "21B8D80A41",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "The third C, it's compatibility.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "20CD766058",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 69,
        "endOffset": 96,
        "text": "Will you get along with us?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5C0AF829F6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 96,
        "text": "Every time a new person joins a team, the others on it want to know: Will you get along with us?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5DA08899E5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 29,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "you're already expressing compatibility",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1DD845C441",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 69,
        "text": "By initiating conversations, you're already expressing compatibility.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0EA68560C3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 98,
        "endOffset": 118,
        "text": "invisible swim lanes",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CAC2DF9063",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 168,
        "text": "But while you're at it, use this time to try and identify who's in charge of what or what I call “invisible swim lanes.” Let's say you've just started a new remote job.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C4486C3E5D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "First, ask your manager if there's an org chart.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3EFAC58F93",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 43,
        "text": "It's a diagram showing who reports to whom.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "63993DBC75",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "And if there is one, amazing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4A7BAE240D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 97,
        "text": "But formal job titles and reporting lines can only tell you so much about how things really work.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D62CAD6A8C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "So when you're in meetings and group chats, pay attention.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F14C72E824",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "What's each person's role?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EA3C35A397",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 20,
        "text": "Who reports to whom?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3AE47B8977",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 105,
        "text": "Who's on whose side, who commands respect, which behaviors get rewarded and which behaviors get punished?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "45E3C76992",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 190,
        "endOffset": 231,
        "text": "while you're mapping out these swim lanes",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "18C5B8BBA3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 56,
        "endOffset": 66,
        "text": "swim lanes",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "57BB89DBEE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 39,
        "endOffset": 137,
        "text": "competent enough to spot gaps, committed enough to fill them and compatible enough to not overstep",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "468A3E68B0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "Here’s the reality of starting a new job.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BD0172BDAF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "Doing your job is only part of it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7549C65C8B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 54,
        "text": "The rest is about how you get along with other people.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E47B65F902",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 62,
        "endOffset": 89,
        "text": "don't forget to do the same",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A3E8ED974A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "Is this an environment where you can flourish and do your best work?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A322D49C89",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "Can you see yourself getting along with your coworkers?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "12FA41A95C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "54",
        "end": "54",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 39,
        "text": "Is this even work you're excited to do?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8E954AD4DB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 30,
        "text": "Every job is a two-way street.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E960516D96",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 44,
        "text": "You can do well only if you want to do well.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9E3F89D0F3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "57",
        "end": "57",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "And if you're set up to do well.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "113151C4CC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "58",
        "end": "58",
        "startOffset": 3,
        "endOffset": 94,
        "text": "look around, reflect and be honest with yourself about whether this is a good place for you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A42C79B476",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    }
  ]
}